@----------------------------------------
@node TYPES
@prev FUNCDEFS
@next STATEMENTS
@toc INDEX
@{h1}Type definitions include scalar types, arrays, and pointers.

<type>          ::= <scalartype>
                  | <arraytype>
                  | <pointertype>

<scalartype>    ::= "char" | "byte" | "int"

<arraytype>     ::= <scalartype> "[" <number> "]"

<pointertype>   ::= <scalartype> "*"

<arglist>       ::= <arg> { "," <arg> }

<arg>           ::= <type> <ident>
